        },
        {
          "text": "Guyya kud'anneeso, ka jia qara, ka ganna diddami shaneeso ka nu haga nu boojiani teenne, ka ammalle Yerusalemuni haga qabani ganna kud'ani afuri teete, guyyuma suni jabeenni AABBO Waaqa nati d'ufe, fuud'e ",
          "type": "text",
