                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.1+2CH.3.2+2CH.3.3+2CH.3.4+2CH.3.5+2CH.3.6+2CH.3.7+2CH.3.8+2CH.3.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Od-dur 3.1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani anini akuma inni baane kaani laale, Mana Waaqa ka naabo d'akhaatini marsani jaarani arge. Namichi ule isaa ta woini biimani ta d'eerinni isii d'und'uma jaa, fuud'e, naabo suni biime. Naabo suni d'eerinni isii ule toko furdinnileeni ule toko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni ammalle fullo ilaboruti fuula deebitu taani d'aqe, faano gula iti olikore, gubba geennaani inni balbala suni biime, biimani furdinna mikhikila balbala suni ule toko tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balbala suni, yo keesa seenani oldabrani, mirgaa bita d'iibu saditi jira, ka nami woi eegu keesa ejaanju. D'iibu suni ch'ufa d'eerinnafi ballinnileeni d'und'uma jaa jaa. D'iibu suni ch'ufa, kutaani isi jiddu, d'und'uma shani. D'iibu keesati woi eegani, yo ejata sadi dabrani, mana Mana Waaqati fuula deefatu tokooni bahani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni mana suni biime jennaani mani sunini d'und'uma saddeeti tae. Mana sunifi fullooni Mana Waaqati d'iaatu taani wolti ejiti, furdinni girgida isaa ka Mana Waaqati aanuleeni d'und'uma lama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.8+EZK.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.8",
              "EZK.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(D'iibuni keesaa woi eegani tunini ta balbala qara seenaniini taani mirgaa bita jirtu ch'ufti haguma taka, kuta jiddu d'iibu suni jirtule ch'ufa furdinni isii haguma taka.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eegi suni namichi kaani ballina kara d'ibu taani jiddu jiru biime, biimani isaa d'und'uma kud'ani sadi taate, ammalle balbala olinisenanile biime, biimani isii d'und'uma kud'ani taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iibu keesati woi eegani taani ch'ufa dura kuta gagabaabdu, d'eerinnafi furdinni isii d'und'uma tokoti jira. (D'iibu suni ch'ufa, biimani isii d'eerinnafi furdinnileeni d'und'uma jaa jaa.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni d'iibu mirgaafi bitaatifi kara jiddu deemule wolti biime, d'eerinni isi d'und'uma diddami shani tae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana suni hojja moga tanaani seenani dinqa moga taanitini keesaa bahani ch'icha ballo tokoti bahani. Inni ballina dinqa suni biime, biimani isaa d'und'uma diddama taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Karaani jiddu mana suni keesa deemu haguma balbala moga tanaati eje, balabala moga taaniti eja, d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma shantama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iibufi dinqi mana suni ch'ufti boro duubani deresha qaba. Kutani d'iibu taani jiddu jirtu ch'ufti gole qabdi. Kuta garaa keesa moga karaati aantu, waan aka meet'i jira, ta irati boch'ani barreesani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naabo alaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi kaani balbala dinqa taani keesani na bahe fulla, naabotini na d'ufe. Ammalle mana sodoma naabo suni moga alaatini iti mat'ansani jaarani. Maneeni suni dura d'akha qarrisani naqani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naabo suni ch'ufaani marsani. Naaboni alaa tunini gabaabate naabo garaa keesa jalaa buuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle balbala iti olkoraniti jira, ta naabo garaa keesatini seenani: Namichi kaani balbala naabo alaatifi ta naabo keesa jiddu biime, biimani isii d'und'uma d'ibba toko taate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Fullo mirgaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani namichi kaani ammalle fullo mirgaa, ta naabo alaatini seenani biime. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "D'iibuni sadeeni eeddoni keesa ejaanjitu taani, ta mirgaa bitaa karaa jirtufi kuta jiddu d'iibu suni ch'ufa jiddu jirtufi dinqale, yo uleeni biimani, biimani waan suni ch'ufti biima fullo ilaborutini qit'e mura. Karaani jiddu mana suni keesa deemu haguma balbala moga tanaati eje, balbala moga taaniti eja, D'eerinni isaa d'und'uma shantama, ballinni d'und'uma diddami shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinqaafi dereshafi meet'ini kuta irati barreesani taanileeni akuma ta fullo ilaboru taani jirti. Fulla suni faano torbati jira, ta balbalatini olkorani, ammalle dinqi kaanileeni naaboti fuula deefata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yo naabo ala taanaani seenani ta garaa keesati taakani, fullo aka fullo ilaboru taaniti jira. Namichi kaani fullo tana lamaani jiddu biime, biimani isii d'und'uma d'ibba toko taate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
