          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani namichi naabo suni moga bitaati na geese achileti fullo d'ibi agarre. Inni fullo sunini biiminaani biimani isiileeni fullo taani d'ibi ch'ufaani woli qit'e taate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maneeni fullo tanaleeni akuma maneeni fullo taani deresha qaqabdi. Karaani jiddu mana suni keesa deemu haguma balbala moga taaniti eje, balbala moga taaniti eja, d'eerinni isaa d'und'uma shantama, ballinni d'und'uma diddami shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Faano torbati jira, ta balbalaani oli korani, ammalle dinqa kaanile naaboti fuula dura jira. Kuta garaa keesa, moga karaati aantu, waan aka meet'i jira, ta irati boch'ani barreesani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle fulloti jira, ta naabo keesatini seenani. Namichi kaani Fullo tana lamaani jiddu biime, biimani isii d'und'uma d'ibba toko taate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.27",
