          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinqi isiileeni, naabo alaati fuula deefata, kuta garaa keesa moga karaati aantu, waan aka meet'i irati boch'ani barreesani. Faano saddeetiti jira, ta balbala fullo suninitini oli korani.",
          "type": "text",
