        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Maneeni d'aatu fullo mirgati jaarani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naabo alaa suni garaa keesa, mana tokoti jira, ka fullo naabo keesa taaniti mat'ansani jaarani. Mani kunini dinqa naabo ala taaniti fuula deefate eja, duuba achiti hori gubani sorio baasani ch'ufa d'iqani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dinqa suni keesa mesa afuriti jira, mesa suni lama lamaani moga moga d'ad'aabani. Mesa kana irati hori sorio qalanifi ka gubani baasanifi ka sorio dabaani ufi iraa baasani baasanifi, hori sorio gati baasani ch'ufa qalani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana suni alaani mesa afuri d'ibi ka mesa kaani afraani fakaatuti jira, ka lama lamaani fullo mirga taani moga moga ejaanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesaani hori sorio suni irati qalani ch'ufti wolti saddeeti: Mesaani afuri dinqa keesa ejaanja, afuri d'ibileeni naabo keesa ejaanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesa afuri mana fullo naabo keesa alaani iti mat'ansani jaarani kaani keesa jira; mesa suni afraani d'akha boch'aniini mid'aasani, ammalle hori gubani sorio baasani ira kayani. Mesa kana old'eerinni isaa d'und'uma toko, d'eerinni isaa ka dalalleeni d'und'uma tokofi taaku toko, ballinni gubba isaaleeni d'und'uma tokofi taaku toko. Miha huji soriotiini tolchani ch'ufa mesa kana ira naqani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qota mesa suni ch'ufa waan hohookiti iti naqani, ka ch'ufa d'eerinni taaku toko. Fooni sorio qalani ch'ufa mesa kana ira naqani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
