          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni naabo keesatini na d'ufe. Naabo tana keesa mana lamati jira; toko, ka d'aatu fullo mirga jiru, bita fuula deefata, kaani d'ibileeni ka d'aatu fullo bita jiru, fuula mirga deefata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi waan nani jed'e, mani bita fuula deefatu kunini ka qaalole Mana Waaqa keesa hojatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle mani mirga fuula deefatu ka qaalole fulla waan sorio irati qalani hojattu. Qaaloleeni tunini ch'ufti nama d'aloota Sadoki. Gosa Lawi keesa worra ch'allati dandae fulla AABBO Waaqa sorio irati baasaniti d'iaate isaa hojata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naabo garaa keesatifi Mana Waaqa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
