              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namichi kaani naabo garaa keesa biime, d'eerinni isii d'und'uma d'ibba toko tae, ballinnileeni hagasuma tae, biimani isii ch'ufti wolqit'e. Mani Waaqa gama ila adu eja, isa dura waan sorio irati qalaniti jira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jennaani inni balbala bada Mana Waaqatini seenaniini na d'ufe. Inni balbala suni biime: Furdinni mikhikila isii d'und'uma shani tae, ballinni isiileeni d'und'uma kud'ani afuri tae; furdinni girgida isii, ka gama lachu d'und'uma shani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 40:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada suni faano itiini olkoraniti jira. Ballinni bada suni d'und'uma kud'ani lama. Bada suni dura utuba lamati moga moga ejaanja.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.40.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.40.49"
            ]
          }
